#, fuzzy
msgid "Sources: https://github.com/openjdk/jdk/blob/master/src/hotspot/share/oops/instanceStackChunkKlass.hpp[`InstanceStackChunkKlass.hpp`] and https://github.com/openjdk/jdk/blob/master/src/hotspot/share/runtime/continuationFreezeThaw.cpp[`continuationFreezeThaw.cpp`], from https://github.com/openjdk/jdk/commit/9583e3657e43cc1c6f2101a64534564db2a9bd84[JDK-8284161]."
